Will require opening a document first.

[photocraft] Drag Direction Point
Params doc: {"name":str|"work"|"layer"="work","layer":id? (with "layer": a shape layer's path or a vector mask),"subpath":i,"knot":j,"handle":"in|out","to":[x,y],"independent":bool=false (a smooth point turns its other handle to stay collinear; independent = ⌥ / Convert Point, makes a corner)} → {name,path}
Will require opening a document first.

[photocraft] Drag Segment
Params doc: {"name":str|"work"|"layer"="work","layer":id? (with "layer": a shape layer's path or a vector mask),"subpath":i,"knot":j (the segment leaving it),"t":0..1=0.5 (where it was grabbed),"move":[dx,dy] (a straight segment moves with its anchors; a curve reshapes through the dragged point)} → {name,path}
Will require opening a document first.

[photocraft] Convert Point
Params doc: {"name":str|"work"|"layer"="work","layer":id? (with "layer": a shape layer's path or a vector mask),"subpath":i,"knot":j,"out":[x,y]? (none: corner with retracted handles; given: smooth with this out handle and its mirror)} → {name,path}
Will require opening a document first.

[photocraft] Add Anchor Point
Params doc: {"name":str|"work"|"layer"="work","layer":id? (with "layer": a shape layer's path or a vector mask),"subpath":i,"knot":j (the segment leaving it),"t":0<t<1=0.5 (where on the segment) (a curve is split there without changing its shape and gets a smooth anchor; a straight segment gets a corner) (the result also has anchor:{subpath,knot})} → {name,path}
Will require opening a document first.

[photocraft] Delete Anchor Point
Params doc: {"name":str|"work"|"layer"="work","layer":id? (with "layer": a shape layer's path or a vector mask),"subpath":i,"knot":j (its neighbours are joined, keeping their handles; a subpath's last anchor removes the subpath; the path's only anchor is refused) (the result also has subpathRemoved:bool)} → {name,path}
Will require opening a document first.

